# nodejs_middleware environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env in the same directory and fill in real values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env must never be committed -- confirm it's listed in .gitignore
# (this repo's gitignore file is oddly named "gitIgnore" -- double check
# .env is actually covered by it, or rename/fix that file).
#
# Every variable below is read somewhere in the running app (index.js via
# `npm run server`, keys.js, config/db.js, config/postgres.js,
# config/redisClient.js) or consumed directly by docker-compose.yml.

# --- PostgreSQL ---------------------------------------------------------
